Third-party licenses
====================

This binary is built from the Rust crates listed below. Each crate is used
under the licence shown beside it, and the licence texts follow the list.

Where a crate's package carries no licence file, the standard text of its
licence is given, with a placeholder where the copyright holder would be
named. The holders of such a crate are the authors named in the list.

